1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,960
I want you to save a fellow magical girl.

2
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,600
Her name is Iroha Tamaki.

3
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:14,200
All rumors are connected at their core.

4
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:20,520
Iroha Tamaki went to the Memory Museum and then she disappeared.

5
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:27,480
The only place she could be is somewhere in the rumor of the Eternal Sakura.

6
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:30,480
Iroha...Iroha...

7
00:00:33,480 --> 00:00:35,480
It's her doppel!

8
00:02:15,010 --> 00:02:40,010
I'm hungry, Master Yachiyo, you cooked breakfast today!

9
00:02:40,010 --> 00:02:44,010
Don't tell me you forgot, let's go get up!

10
00:02:44,010 --> 00:02:46,010
I'm dying of starvation!

11
00:02:46,010 --> 00:02:50,010
Quit bugging her, let's wash up and wait at the table.

12
00:02:50,010 --> 00:02:55,010
What's going on? The last thing I remember is finding Iroha in that rumor.

13
00:02:55,010 --> 00:02:57,010
Gee, you look super tired today!

14
00:02:57,010 --> 00:03:02,010
Oh, if you're not feeling up to it, me and Iroha can cook.

15
00:03:02,010 --> 00:03:03,010
Iroha?!

16
00:03:03,010 --> 00:03:07,010
Hey, where is Iroha anyway? Still squeaking I bet.

17
00:03:14,010 --> 00:03:30,010
Good morning, Yachiyo. Did I oversleep again?

18
00:03:30,010 --> 00:03:36,010
Are you okay?

19
00:03:36,010 --> 00:03:40,010
I am now.

20
00:03:40,010 --> 00:03:42,010
Yachiyo...

21
00:03:42,010 --> 00:03:54,010
I don't know anyone who can cook a better breakfast than Yachiyo.

22
00:03:54,010 --> 00:03:56,010
Her eggs always look so perfect!

23
00:03:56,010 --> 00:04:00,010
You know, you should get your dad to take some lessons from her.

24
00:04:00,010 --> 00:04:02,010
What for? He's a great cook!

25
00:04:02,010 --> 00:04:04,010
Ban Banzai's food is the best in Kamehama!

26
00:04:04,010 --> 00:04:08,010
I hate to say it, but we've been absorbed by Iroha's topple.

27
00:04:08,010 --> 00:04:12,010
Oh, good! It's right in the middle between awesome and yucky!

28
00:04:12,010 --> 00:04:14,010
I was afraid of that.

29
00:04:14,010 --> 00:04:17,010
What's the deal with this house, though?

30
00:04:17,010 --> 00:04:19,010
Well, I don't mind the food there.

31
00:04:19,010 --> 00:04:22,010
Mikazuki Villa. Those girls and I lived here.

32
00:04:22,010 --> 00:04:27,010
So did Iroha for a bit.

33
00:04:27,010 --> 00:04:28,010
Hey, Kuroe!

34
00:04:28,010 --> 00:04:30,010
If you don't want your ham, can I have it?

35
00:04:32,010 --> 00:04:34,010
I didn't know you and Felicia knew each other.

36
00:04:34,010 --> 00:04:37,010
No, I don't know her. I never met her before.

37
00:04:37,010 --> 00:04:41,010
Oh, hey, Kuroe. That book you let me borrow? It was such a good read.

38
00:04:45,010 --> 00:04:48,010
I get it. You were Iroha's friend.

39
00:04:48,010 --> 00:04:50,010
Yeah, I guess I sorta was.

40
00:04:52,010 --> 00:04:59,010
If you know anything about the labyrinth of this rumor, you need to tell me right now.

41
00:05:01,010 --> 00:05:03,010
It's all written down here.

42
00:05:06,010 --> 00:05:08,010
It's called the Eternal Sakura.

43
00:05:08,010 --> 00:05:12,010
Somehow, its power is tied to Iroha's memories.

44
00:05:12,010 --> 00:05:14,010
Yeah, it looks like it is.

45
00:05:16,010 --> 00:05:19,010
Is something wrong, Yachiyo? You haven't touched your breakfast.

46
00:05:19,010 --> 00:05:24,010
Yroha. It is you, isn't it?

47
00:05:24,010 --> 00:05:25,010
Huh?

48
00:05:26,010 --> 00:05:29,010
If it is you, you're sweet and curious.

49
00:05:29,010 --> 00:05:32,010
And you care about your little sister.

50
00:05:33,010 --> 00:05:34,010
My sister?

51
00:05:35,010 --> 00:05:36,010
My sister!

52
00:05:36,010 --> 00:05:37,010
My sister!

53
00:05:45,010 --> 00:05:46,010
Wait.

54
00:05:46,010 --> 00:05:48,010
What the heck? Why are we here?

55
00:05:48,010 --> 00:05:50,010
Wow, talk about spacing out.

56
00:05:50,010 --> 00:05:52,010
We're all going to visit my little sister.

57
00:05:53,010 --> 00:05:55,010
I didn't know you had a little sister.

58
00:05:55,010 --> 00:05:56,010
Oh.

59
00:05:56,010 --> 00:05:59,010
Well, she's been in the hospital for a while now.

60
00:06:00,010 --> 00:06:01,010
Here we are!

61
00:06:01,010 --> 00:06:02,010
Here we are!

62
00:06:08,010 --> 00:06:11,010
Uwasa, uwasa, fun and spooky uwasa.

63
00:06:12,010 --> 00:06:15,010
Uwasa, uwasa, weird and kooky uwasa.

64
00:06:16,010 --> 00:06:19,010
We'll make up rumors as homes for the uwasa.

65
00:06:20,010 --> 00:06:23,010
What are the leaders of Magius doing here?

66
00:06:24,010 --> 00:06:26,010
They were friends of Iroha's little sister.

67
00:06:27,010 --> 00:06:30,010
Toka, Nemu and her all shared the same room at the hospital.

68
00:06:32,010 --> 00:06:34,010
That girl in yellow, is she Nemu Hiragi?

69
00:06:35,010 --> 00:06:36,010
That's her.

70
00:06:37,010 --> 00:06:41,010
Hey, your friend's face at the friendship bending staircase.

71
00:06:42,010 --> 00:06:43,010
This one's called the Seance Shrine.

72
00:06:44,010 --> 00:06:45,010
I'm the thing you left behind.

73
00:06:46,010 --> 00:06:48,010
There's good fortune water if what you want's luck.

74
00:06:49,010 --> 00:06:54,010
And endless solitude for lonely moods when your nights are dark.

75
00:06:55,010 --> 00:06:57,010
I wonder how they know about the rumors.

76
00:06:58,010 --> 00:06:59,010
Maybe it's because of Nemu.

77
00:07:00,010 --> 00:07:02,010
She told me she made up all the rumors in Kamehama City.

78
00:07:02,010 --> 00:07:06,010
Are these Iroha's memories all jumbled up?

79
00:07:07,010 --> 00:07:11,010
Or is there a connection between the rumors in Kamehama and this room?

80
00:07:13,010 --> 00:07:15,010
Where's Ui? She should be here.

81
00:07:16,010 --> 00:07:17,010
Who's that?

82
00:07:17,010 --> 00:07:19,010
Iroha's little sister. That's who.

83
00:07:20,010 --> 00:07:23,010
Come on out, Ui, and help us make up some rumors.

84
00:07:25,010 --> 00:07:26,010
That's Ui?

85
00:07:27,010 --> 00:07:28,010
No way.

86
00:07:28,010 --> 00:07:33,010
Yeah, sure.

87
00:07:34,010 --> 00:07:37,010
She wants us all to go to her favorite theme park, to Culation Land.

88
00:07:38,010 --> 00:07:39,010
That would be wonderful!

89
00:07:40,010 --> 00:07:44,010
It'll be okay, Ui. Promise.

90
00:07:45,010 --> 00:07:48,010
When you get better, I'll take you anywhere you want.

91
00:07:49,010 --> 00:07:52,010
I'm your big sis. I'll do whatever I can to make you happy.

92
00:07:52,010 --> 00:07:59,010
I'm here, and I won't leave you ever again.

93
00:08:02,010 --> 00:08:07,010
Where are we? Is it Iroha's imagination? Or are we stuck in her dream?

94
00:08:08,010 --> 00:08:09,010
Is that possible?

95
00:08:09,010 --> 00:08:15,010
It has to be. Everyone Iroha's met are friends here. Like you and the girls at Mikazuki Villa.

96
00:08:16,010 --> 00:08:20,010
And Iroha's the only one who would dream about her missing sister like this.

97
00:08:21,010 --> 00:08:23,010
So this must be her dream.

98
00:08:28,010 --> 00:08:29,010
Stop that!

99
00:08:29,010 --> 00:08:35,010
That proves it. This space isn't real.

100
00:08:35,010 --> 00:08:37,010
You're right. But what could be causing it?

101
00:08:38,010 --> 00:08:41,010
Nemu said she's the one who created the rumors, right?

102
00:08:42,010 --> 00:08:43,010
Yeah.

103
00:08:44,010 --> 00:08:48,010
Everything here is specific to Iroha's experiences, so Nemu couldn't have created it.

104
00:08:49,010 --> 00:08:51,010
The only thing that could have is Iroha's doppel.

105
00:08:52,010 --> 00:08:54,010
They didn't know they could do that?

106
00:08:55,010 --> 00:08:59,010
A soul gem's taint can be confined to a part of your body so you can use its power.

107
00:09:00,010 --> 00:09:01,010
That's a doppel.

108
00:09:02,010 --> 00:09:05,010
And since it's also technically a witch, it can create a labyrinth.

109
00:09:06,010 --> 00:09:08,010
That's true, I guess.

110
00:09:09,010 --> 00:09:13,010
The only way we can escape this dream is by defeating Iroha's doppel.

111
00:09:14,010 --> 00:09:17,010
What worries me is that her doppel's been active too long,

112
00:09:17,010 --> 00:09:21,010
and who knows what kind of damage that's causing to her soul gem.

113
00:09:22,010 --> 00:09:23,010
It could be irreparable.

114
00:09:25,010 --> 00:09:26,010
Find the door.

115
00:09:27,010 --> 00:09:29,010
I don't see one anywhere, do you?

116
00:09:30,010 --> 00:09:33,010
I have a feeling it's in the most obvious place.

117
00:09:33,010 --> 00:09:46,010
This could be an escape route. Or a trap.

118
00:09:47,010 --> 00:09:49,010
Either way, it's the weirdest thing here.

119
00:09:51,010 --> 00:09:53,010
Wait! I'm coming too!

120
00:09:54,010 --> 00:09:57,010
I don't want your help, especially since you're with the Magius.

121
00:09:58,010 --> 00:10:01,010
Go find a place to hide. Stay there until Iroha wakes up.

122
00:10:01,010 --> 00:10:02,010
O-okay.

123
00:10:05,010 --> 00:10:06,010
Um, wait!

124
00:10:06,010 --> 00:10:11,010
If this is Iroha's dream like you say, then is the Iroha in here the real one?

125
00:10:12,010 --> 00:10:13,010
Good question.

126
00:10:14,010 --> 00:10:15,010
I have no proof.

127
00:10:16,010 --> 00:10:19,010
But I think she is all that's real.

128
00:10:19,010 --> 00:10:28,010
So this is her dream, huh?

129
00:10:29,010 --> 00:10:33,010
It's giving me the creeps, just like a witch's labyrinth.

130
00:10:34,010 --> 00:10:35,010
A witch?

131
00:10:36,010 --> 00:10:37,010
There's a witch!

132
00:10:37,010 --> 00:10:38,010
Everyone, be careful!

133
00:10:39,010 --> 00:10:40,010
Kyuubi!

134
00:10:41,010 --> 00:10:43,010
I have left this attack!

135
00:10:43,010 --> 00:10:44,010
Back off, you!

136
00:10:46,010 --> 00:10:47,010
I have left this attack!

137
00:10:52,010 --> 00:10:53,010
Back off, you!

138
00:10:54,010 --> 00:10:56,010
Rada! Maduro!

139
00:10:57,010 --> 00:10:58,010
Yes! We did!

140
00:10:58,010 --> 00:10:59,010
Don't mess with Team Mikazuki Villa!

141
00:10:59,010 --> 00:11:13,010
She looks and sounds enough like the real Iroha.

142
00:11:14,010 --> 00:11:16,010
But how can I tell it's really her?

143
00:11:16,010 --> 00:11:27,010
I have no idea what the point of this dream is. Why would Iroha's doppel want to trap us in it?

144
00:11:28,010 --> 00:11:30,010
I need to figure out how to wake her up.

145
00:11:30,010 --> 00:11:43,010
Good morning, Yachiyo. Did I oversleep?

146
00:11:44,010 --> 00:11:46,010
I think the dream's falling apart.

147
00:11:47,010 --> 00:11:49,010
Come on, wake up! I'm hungry!

148
00:11:50,010 --> 00:11:52,010
Master Yachiyo, you cooked breakfast today!

149
00:11:53,010 --> 00:11:55,010
Don't bug her. Let's wash up and lay at the taste!

150
00:12:00,010 --> 00:12:05,010
Suruno! Let's set off some parachute fireworks!

151
00:12:06,010 --> 00:12:10,010
Those are only fun in the daytime, when we can see them!

152
00:12:11,010 --> 00:12:12,010
There's no point at night!

153
00:12:13,010 --> 00:12:14,010
Kuroi? What's wrong?

154
00:12:15,010 --> 00:12:18,010
Nothing. I was just spacing out a little is all.

155
00:12:21,010 --> 00:12:23,010
You can tell me if something's bothering you.

156
00:12:24,010 --> 00:12:26,010
I don't know how much I can help, but I can certainly try.

157
00:12:28,010 --> 00:12:29,010
Thank you.

158
00:12:29,010 --> 00:12:32,010
Her dream world is calm and peaceful. Just like her.

159
00:12:33,010 --> 00:12:35,010
We should do some of those snake fireworks next!

160
00:12:36,010 --> 00:12:39,010
Those are definitely not fun when it's dark out.

161
00:12:40,010 --> 00:12:42,010
Well, we got some smoke bombs, but that's it for our fireworks.

162
00:12:43,010 --> 00:12:46,010
Save them for tomorrow. Let's have some melon.

163
00:12:47,010 --> 00:12:50,010
If the real person isn't here, she makes a copy of them.

164
00:12:50,010 --> 00:12:51,010
Yachiyo's amazing, isn't she?

165
00:12:51,010 --> 00:13:00,010
She's a magical girl, and she's in college, and she's a model, too!

166
00:13:00,010 --> 00:13:09,010
I saw her on the cover of a magazine yesterday, and I was so proud, I bought a copy for myself!

167
00:13:10,010 --> 00:13:14,010
Remember? When we first met her, she was a little mean, wasn't she?

168
00:13:14,010 --> 00:13:17,010
But that's only because she was worried about us!

169
00:13:17,010 --> 00:13:19,010
Turns out, she's super sweet!

170
00:13:19,010 --> 00:13:36,010
Irohal, are you happy like this?

171
00:13:37,010 --> 00:13:38,010
Huh?

172
00:13:39,010 --> 00:13:44,010
Like, if this were a dream, and you could do anything, what would you want to do the most?

173
00:13:45,010 --> 00:13:50,010
A dream? I never thought about it, but I guess there's nothing else I could hope for.

174
00:13:50,010 --> 00:13:56,010
Huh? Nothing? I'm kind of the same way, I guess.

175
00:13:57,010 --> 00:14:03,010
I'm fine right where I am, doing what I'm doing. I have my friends to share these moments with.

176
00:14:04,010 --> 00:14:09,010
Everyone's shared so much with me already. You, Yachiyo, and the others, too.

177
00:14:10,010 --> 00:14:11,010
Really?

178
00:14:20,010 --> 00:14:28,010
Of all the suspicious things here, you are the most suspicious.

179
00:14:29,010 --> 00:14:32,010
Now then, Ui. Are you Iroha's doppel?

180
00:14:43,010 --> 00:14:45,010
It seems I'm back to square one.

181
00:14:50,010 --> 00:14:59,010
I was wondering, Iroha, why'd you pick a teddy bear?

182
00:15:00,010 --> 00:15:01,010
What do you mean?

183
00:15:02,010 --> 00:15:05,010
Like, why'd you pick that, instead of your real sister?

184
00:15:07,010 --> 00:15:09,010
Why would you say something like that?

185
00:15:10,010 --> 00:15:14,010
It's just, you were looking all over for her, so you obviously care about her.

186
00:15:14,010 --> 00:15:16,010
So it's weird that here...

187
00:15:17,010 --> 00:15:19,010
I mean, she's a teddy bear.

188
00:15:20,010 --> 00:15:22,010
How could you say something so mean?

189
00:15:23,010 --> 00:15:24,010
I was just asking.

190
00:15:25,010 --> 00:15:27,010
Why do you hate her? She never did anything to you.

191
00:15:28,010 --> 00:15:31,010
I don't hate her. I never even met her.

192
00:15:33,010 --> 00:15:34,010
I don't understand.

193
00:15:35,010 --> 00:15:37,010
Why is Ui not human?

194
00:15:38,010 --> 00:15:41,010
Yachiyo, what are you doing way out here?

195
00:15:41,010 --> 00:15:42,010
Iroha, we have to leave this place, now.

196
00:15:42,010 --> 00:15:53,010
But everyone will be sad if you don't come to the hospital.

197
00:15:54,010 --> 00:15:56,010
Where's your sister? Your real sister?

198
00:15:57,010 --> 00:15:58,010
Huh?

199
00:15:58,010 --> 00:15:59,010
Everyone you know is here except Ui.

200
00:16:00,010 --> 00:16:01,010
She's right here, see?

201
00:16:01,010 --> 00:16:04,010
I love my little sis more than anything.

202
00:16:05,010 --> 00:16:08,010
And I'd do pretty much anything if it's for Ui.

203
00:16:09,010 --> 00:16:10,010
No!

204
00:16:10,010 --> 00:16:11,010
Let's go!

205
00:16:11,010 --> 00:16:12,010
Iroha, what's wrong?

206
00:16:12,010 --> 00:16:13,010
Why are you getting in my way?

207
00:16:13,010 --> 00:16:14,010
Why are you getting in my way?

208
00:16:14,010 --> 00:16:17,010
Iroha, what's wrong?

209
00:16:17,010 --> 00:16:19,010
Iroha, what's wrong?

210
00:16:19,010 --> 00:16:22,010
Why are you getting in my way?

211
00:16:23,010 --> 00:16:24,010
Iroha, what's wrong?

212
00:16:24,010 --> 00:16:29,010
Iroha, what's wrong?

213
00:16:29,010 --> 00:16:31,010
Iroha, what's wrong?

214
00:16:31,010 --> 00:16:33,010
Iroha? What's wrong?

215
00:16:36,390 --> 00:16:38,390
Why are you getting in my way?

216
00:16:42,890 --> 00:16:46,610
Iroha Tamaki fell into a deep sleep at the bottom of the room.

217
00:16:47,570 --> 00:16:48,890
But then...

218
00:16:48,890 --> 00:16:55,430
Her fears about her sister and her knowledge about the truth of magical girls caused her to have nightmares.

219
00:16:56,470 --> 00:16:57,830
Disturbing nightmares.

220
00:16:57,830 --> 00:17:02,170
Now, her soul gem has become even more tainted.

221
00:17:03,130 --> 00:17:05,150
Why are you trying to stop me?

222
00:17:05,470 --> 00:17:08,030
I made new dreams to cancel out her nightmares.

223
00:17:08,690 --> 00:17:10,210
I made a new Mikazuki villa.

224
00:17:10,630 --> 00:17:11,850
I worked so hard.

225
00:17:15,090 --> 00:17:15,830
Iroha...

226
00:17:16,390 --> 00:17:19,230
I even made her a new sister.

227
00:17:19,710 --> 00:17:20,570
A new Ui.

228
00:17:21,090 --> 00:17:23,910
A new Ui Tamaki for Iroha Tamaki.

229
00:17:24,430 --> 00:17:25,110
For me.

230
00:17:25,110 --> 00:17:28,870
But when I met you, you were still looking for her.

231
00:17:29,190 --> 00:17:30,410
I couldn't find her.

232
00:17:30,610 --> 00:17:31,910
So I made a new one.

233
00:17:35,530 --> 00:17:37,130
I did it because I'm scared.

234
00:17:37,590 --> 00:17:39,690
I'm scared I'll never see her again.

235
00:17:40,050 --> 00:17:43,190
I'm scared that someday all my friends will disappear too.

236
00:17:43,770 --> 00:17:44,530
I'm scared.

237
00:17:45,490 --> 00:17:46,690
I'm so scared.

238
00:17:46,690 --> 00:17:48,070
I'll start fresh.

239
00:17:48,230 --> 00:17:50,470
I'll make a new story for Iroha Tamaki.

240
00:17:51,890 --> 00:17:52,990
Leave her alone.

241
00:17:53,230 --> 00:17:53,790
Stop it.

242
00:17:54,070 --> 00:17:54,490
Iroha!

243
00:17:54,810 --> 00:17:55,790
Snap out of it!

244
00:17:56,130 --> 00:17:59,110
This is Iroha Tamaki's new story.

245
00:18:03,490 --> 00:18:04,210
Iroha!

246
00:18:04,210 --> 00:18:08,570
I got you.

247
00:18:10,090 --> 00:18:10,890
I'm sorry.

248
00:18:11,690 --> 00:18:13,770
The doppel was hiding in her the whole time.

249
00:18:14,210 --> 00:18:17,350
It said it created a new sister for Iroha.

250
00:18:17,770 --> 00:18:20,410
With a new Ui and a new Mikazuki villa,

251
00:18:20,870 --> 00:18:22,470
Iroha Tamaki will be happy.

252
00:18:22,790 --> 00:18:24,570
So stop trying to destroy it.

253
00:18:24,570 --> 00:18:31,950
Get back.

254
00:18:32,250 --> 00:18:33,590
